; buildings (docs/ART.md 11.5): class icons, so the city queue and the building lists scan by kind.
; Temples carry their faith's glyph (in 8 px lists the faith glyph itself stands for the temple:
; ui.js iconFor); world wonders a spire under the gilt star; the rest a silhouette per class.
; Which building takes which class: manifest.txt ("buildings").

